  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<em>Replace this with a proper description.</em>\n<details>\n<summary>Credits and Instructions</summary>\n<h2>Made by Elwin</h2>\n<h3>Requires:</h3>\n<ul>\n   <li>Times-up (less than v14)</li>\n   <li>Elwin Helpers (Enable in Settings)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Usage:</strong></p>\n<p>This item needs to be used to activate. When Flurry of Blows activity is used, allows to make multiples\nUnarmed Strike attacks, it also supports features that adds additional attacks (like Heightened Focus).\nWhen Patient Defense or Step of the Wind are used, the appropriate effects are applied to the Monk.</p></details>",
